&lt;p&gt;YOUR RESPONSIBILITIES WILL INCLUDE&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;1. Requirement Elicitation and Analysis&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Support in conducting requirement surveys based on project and client specifications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Assist in client discussions to understand core business needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Contribute to analyzing and documenting current operational pain points.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;2. Solution Development and Documentation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Collaborate with project development teams to create preliminary solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Utilize tools such as Mock-ups, Design diagrams, etc., to illustrate proposed solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Support in Producing and finalizing comprehensive Functional Specification (FS) documents.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;3. Project Facilitation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Participate in project development activities, including liaising with design teams for product interface design.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Assist in articulating project logic to development engineers and system architects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Support test engineers in executing system tests per requirement documents.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;4. Document Preparation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Co-author Use Cases, User Guides, and other project-related documentation in collaboration with project team members.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;5. Client Engagement and Post-Implementation Support&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Assist clients in conducting user acceptance tests.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Contribute to facilitating smooth transition processes for new and existing systems postimplementation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Assist in conducting user training sessions as necessary.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;JOB REQUIREMENTS&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Bachelor&#39;s degree or higher, preferably in computer science, software engineering, or related fields. Alternatively, a degree in English and/or Chinese with exceptional spoken proficiency is a plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Chinese speaker is preferred even if no previous experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Proficiency in English, with exceptional listening, speaking, reading, and writing skills. Prior experience in overseas study or work is advantageous.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Proficient in office automation tools, including Microsoft Office and Miro.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Strong interpersonal and teamwork skills, with the ability to manage concurrent tasks effectively.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Strong analytical, communication, and learning abilities, enabling quick comprehension and exploration of client requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WORK LOCATION 18th floor, 19th floor, 65 Hai Phong, Thach Thang ward, Hai Chau district, Da Nang&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ui-provider a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak&quot;&gt;Any personal data you share with us during the application process will be processed strictly in compliance with applicable data protection laws and our &lt;a id=&quot;menur12n&quot; class=&quot;fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn&quot; href=&quot;https://www.avepoint.com/company/privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

