&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As a Strategic Consultant, you are someone who loves working as a consultant on software delivery projects with external customers. Ideal candidates should enterprise level&amp;nbsp;expertise&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;SharePoint,&amp;nbsp;Microsoft&amp;nbsp;365&amp;nbsp;and relevant services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
